  lines:
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: Hopefully it was easy for you or you will have problems to pass this one.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: a6dce48185b1cf24fb9f542767adc9c2, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: When you land on the platform you will need to shoot 3 moving targerts
      before they get to the end or you fail.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: ca5a1075237da5545b10438e8106affd, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: Good luck! On the next level I will show you something interesting.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: 9804a0ccb68c4404f9d2f5dce9c70874, type: 3}
